---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | Toolbox Image" description="How Toolbox Image handles your data: processing happens in your browser, images are not uploaded to our servers." path="/privacy" lang="en" altLang={null}>
  <div class="legal-wrap">
    <section class="legal-hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">LEGAL</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lede">Last updated: June 5, 2026</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">1</span>Privacy by design</h2>
      <p>Our blur, compression, grain filter, and video frame tools are designed to process files locally in your browser. For those browser-based tools, your images or videos are not uploaded to our servers as part of the normal editing workflow.</p>
      <p>Images are enhanced locally in your browser. The AI model downloads only when you run the tool and is cached for later visits.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">2</span>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect only the limited information needed to operate and improve the site:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Basic usage and analytics data such as page views, browser type, device type, and referring pages.</li>
        <li>Cookie-related preferences used to remember consent choices and understand site usage.</li>
        <li>Email information you choose to send when contacting support.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not require user accounts to use the main tool, and we do not ask you to register, sign in with social media, or maintain a user profile to blur images.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">3</span>How we use information</h2>
      <p>We use information to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Keep the site working reliably.</li>
        <li>Understand how visitors use the site and improve performance and usability.</li>
        <li>Respond to support requests and feedback.</li>
        <li>Protect the service against abuse, spam, or technical issues.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">4</span>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>We use cookies and similar technologies for essential site functions, consent management, and analytics. You can learn more in our <a href="/cookie">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">5</span>Sharing of information</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share limited technical data with service providers that help us operate the site, such as analytics, hosting, or security vendors, but only as needed for those services.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">6</span>Data retention</h2>
      <p>Images are enhanced locally in your browser. The AI model downloads only when you run the tool and is cached for later visits.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">7</span>Data security</h2>
      <p>We use reasonable administrative and technical measures to protect the information we control. No internet transmission or storage system is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">8</span>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can control cookies through your browser settings and the cookie banner where available. If you contact us and want us to review or delete information you provided by email, contact us at the address below.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">9</span>External links</h2>
      <p>The site may link to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those third parties.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">10</span>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will update the effective date on this page.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">11</span>Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or your information, contact Toolbox Image at <a href="mailto:yangkunming2026@gmail.com">yangkunming2026@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
